{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Savings Wallet API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "API REST de solo lectura sobre la cuenta belo del usuario. No mueve fondos ni otorga préstamos.\n\n**Origen de los datos** (igual en todos los endpoints con datos de usuario)\n- Si el servidor corre con `BELO_DEMO_PROFILE` (`family`, `salaried`, `erratic`, `short_history`), usa ese perfil sintético y no requiere credencial.\n- Si no, usa la cuenta belo del header `X-Belo-Api-Key`.\n\n**dashboard**: panel de gastos con la forma de `mocks/mock-transactions.json`; montos como números JSON.\n\n**scoring**: score crediticio, desglose de reglas y oferta preaprobada simulada. El cálculo es determinístico (reglas fijas en `scoring_engine/config.py`, versionadas); ningún LLM interviene. Montos y ratios como strings decimales, igual que la API de belo."
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "/",
      "description": "Este servidor"
    },
    {
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8000",
      "description": "Local (uvicorn)"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "dashboard",
      "description": "Panel de gastos"
    },
    {
      "name": "scoring",
      "description": "Score crediticio explicado y oferta preaprobada (simulada). Reglas fijas, sin LLM."
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/dashboard/transactions": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "dashboard"
        ],
        "operationId": "getDashboardTransactions",
        "summary": "Movimientos del usuario para el panel de gastos",
        "description": "Ingresos (`credit`) y gastos (`debit`) de los últimos 180 días, ordenados del más viejo al más nuevo, con cuentas y totales. No incluye transferencias entre cuentas propias ni movimientos pendientes o fallidos.",
        "security": [
          {
            "BeloApiKey": []
          },
          {}
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Movimientos, cuentas y totales",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TransactionsResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Falta la credencial o no da acceso",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "missing_credential": {
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "missing_credential",
                        "message": "Conectá tu cuenta belo (header X-Belo-Api-Key)."
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "unauthorized": {
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "unauthorized",
                        "message": "Tu cuenta belo no dio acceso a los datos necesarios."
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Perfil demo mal configurado en el servidor",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "unknown_demo_profile",
                    "message": "Perfil demo desconocido 'x'. Opciones: salaried, erratic, short_history, family"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "belo no respondió",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "upstream_error",
                    "message": "No pudimos leer tus datos de belo en este momento."
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/scoring/profile": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "scoring"
        ],
        "operationId": "getScoringProfile",
        "summary": "Score crediticio del usuario y oferta preaprobada",
        "description": "Calcula el score sobre los movimientos de los últimos 180 días.\n\n1. **Filtros de elegibilidad** (`rejections`): si alguno falla, no hay score ni oferta.\n2. **Score** (`score.value`) = base 300 + puntos por feature + ajustes; máximo `score.max`.\n3. **Banda** A/B/C/D según el score; D no tiene oferta.\n4. **Oferta** preaprobada (indicativa): monto, plazo, cuota (sistema francés), TNA/TEA/CFT, limitada por capacidad de pago.\n\n`reasons` son las 3 features que más puntos restaron, en lenguaje simple. Las reglas y puntos de cada feature están en `GET /api/scoring/methodology`.",
        "security": [
          {
            "BeloApiKey": []
          },
          {}
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "term_months",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "Plazo deseado en meses. Se ajusta al rango de la banda (mínimo 3).",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Decisión explicada",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ScoringProfile"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "term_months inválido",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "invalid_term_months",
                    "message": "term_months debe ser un entero positivo."
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Falta la credencial o no da acceso",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "missing_credential": {
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "missing_credential",
                        "message": "Conectá tu cuenta belo (header X-Belo-Api-Key)."
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Perfil demo mal configurado en el servidor",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "belo no respondió",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/scoring/methodology": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "scoring"
        ],
        "operationId": "getScoringMethodology",
        "summary": "Reglas, umbrales y puntos de la scorecard vigente",
        "description": "Metodología completa del score como JSON, generada desde la configuración del servidor (siempre coincide con lo que se aplica): pasos del cálculo, filtros de elegibilidad, tramos y puntos por feature, ajustes, bandas y reglas de la oferta. No requiere credencial ni usa datos de usuarios.",
        "security": [
          {}
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Metodología",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Methodology"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "BeloApiKey": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-Belo-Api-Key",
        "description": "API key de belo del usuario (`belo_live_...`). No hace falta con un perfil demo activo."
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "TransactionsResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "version",
          "generatedAt",
          "profile",
          "accounts",
          "transactions",
          "dateRange",
          "stats"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "version": {
            "type": "string",
            "examples": [
              "1.0.0"
            ]
          },
          "generatedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "profile": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Profile"
          },
          "accounts": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Account"
            }
          },
          "transactions": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Transaction"
            }
          },
          "dateRange": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DateRange"
          },
          "stats": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Stats"
          }
        }
      },
      "Profile": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Solo datos derivados de los movimientos; no se inventan datos personales.",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "name",
          "familyMembers",
          "employment",
          "location"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Hash del titular (`demo-<perfil>` en modo demo). Nunca la credencial.",
            "examples": [
              "demo-family"
            ]
          },
          "name": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "Nombre visible. `null` para usuarios reales (belo no lo expone).",
            "examples": [
              "Usuario demo · Familia"
            ]
          },
          "familyMembers": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FamilyMember"
            },
            "description": "Siempre vacío por ahora."
          },
          "employment": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Employment"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Derivado de un ingreso recurrente (mismo pagador en ≥ 3 meses). `null` si no hay sueldo detectado."
          },
          "location": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Location"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Siempre `null` por ahora."
          }
        }
      },
      "FamilyMember": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "relationship": {
            "type": "string",
            "examples": [
              "spouse",
              "child"
            ]
          },
          "birthDate": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date"
          }
        }
      },
      "Employment": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "type",
          "company",
          "position",
          "monthlySalary",
          "payDay"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "examples": [
              "empleado"
            ]
          },
          "company": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "Nombre del pagador del sueldo",
            "examples": [
              "Tech Solutions SA"
            ]
          },
          "position": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "Siempre `null` (no se deriva)."
          },
          "monthlySalary": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Mediana del sueldo en ARS",
            "examples": [
              2800000
            ]
          },
          "payDay": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 31,
            "description": "Día de cobro más frecuente",
            "examples": [
              5
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "Location": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "city": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "province": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "Account": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "type",
          "name",
          "currency",
          "balance"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "examples": [
              "balance-ARGt",
              "vault-demo-vault-vacaciones"
            ]
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "checking",
              "crypto",
              "savings"
            ],
            "description": "`checking` = pesos, `crypto` = cripto/stablecoins, `savings` = vault"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "examples": [
              "Cuenta Belo",
              "Wallet USDT",
              "Vacaciones"
            ]
          },
          "currency": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "ARGt se informa como ARS y BRAt como BRL",
            "examples": [
              "ARS",
              "USDT",
              "BTC"
            ]
          },
          "balance": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Balance"
          }
        }
      },
      "Balance": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "currency",
          "available",
          "updatedAt"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "currency": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "available": {
            "type": "number",
            "examples": [
              1850000
            ]
          },
          "updatedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        }
      },
      "Transaction": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "type",
          "category",
          "amount",
          "currency",
          "amountArs",
          "description",
          "method",
          "createdAt",
          "merchant"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "debit",
              "credit"
            ],
            "description": "`credit` = ingreso, `debit` = gasto"
          },
          "category": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Vocabulario de `mock-transactions.json`, asignado por palabra clave en comercio/contraparte.\n\n- Ingresos: `salario`, `freelance`, `reembolso`, `aguinaldo`, `venta_crypto`.\n- Gastos: `alquiler`, `expensas`, `luz`, `gas`, `agua`, `internet`, `telefono`, `cuota_colegio`, `debito_prepaga`, `debito_gimnasio`, `debito_netflix`, `debito_spotify`, `debito_streaming`, `tarjeta_supermercado`, `tarjeta_combustible`, `tarjeta_restaurante`, `tarjeta_farmacia`, `tarjeta_indumentaria`, `tarjeta_tecnologia`, `uber_taxi`, `peaje`, `seguro_auto`, `impuesto_ganancias`, `compra_crypto`.\n- Sin coincidencia (no están en el mock): `transferencia_recibida`, `deposito_crypto`, `transferencia_enviada`, `tarjeta_otros`, `pix_enviado`, `retiro_crypto`.",
            "examples": [
              "tarjeta_supermercado",
              "salario",
              "alquiler"
            ]
          },
          "amount": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Monto en la moneda original. En gastos incluye fee e impuestos."
          },
          "currency": {
            "type": "string",
            "examples": [
              "ARS",
              "USDT"
            ]
          },
          "amountArs": {
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "Monto en ARS redondeado. `null` si no hay cotización para esa fecha."
          },
          "description": {
            "type": "string",
            "examples": [
              "Transferencia a Inmobiliaria Palermo",
              "JUMBO",
              "Compra de USDT"
            ]
          },
          "method": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "debito_automatico",
              "tarjeta_credito",
              "tarjeta_debito",
              "transferencia",
              "crypto",
              "plazo_fijo"
            ],
            "description": "Hoy se emiten `tarjeta_debito` (tarjeta belo), `transferencia` y `crypto`."
          },
          "createdAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "merchant": {
            "type": "string",
            "examples": [
              "JUMBO",
              "Tech Solutions SA"
            ]
          },
          "card": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CardInfo"
          },
          "crypto": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CryptoInfo"
          },
          "investment": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/InvestmentInfo"
          }
        }
      },
      "CardInfo": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Solo en consumos con tarjeta",
        "properties": {
          "last4": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "examples": [
              "4532"
            ]
          },
          "brand": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "examples": [
              "visa"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "CryptoInfo": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Solo en compras/ventas de cripto (swaps)",
        "properties": {
          "asset": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "examples": [
              "USDT"
            ]
          },
          "amount": {
            "type": [
              "number",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "Cantidad del activo"
          },
          "priceArs": {
            "type": [
              "number",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "Precio de 1 unidad en ARS"
          }
        }
      },
      "InvestmentInfo": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Presente en el mock (plazo fijo); hoy no se emite.",
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "rate": {
            "type": "number"
          },
          "maturityDate": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date"
          }
        }
      },
      "DateRange": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "from",
          "to"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "from": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date"
          },
          "to": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date"
          }
        }
      },
      "Stats": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "totalTransactions",
          "totalIncome",
          "totalExpenses",
          "averageMonthlyIncome",
          "averageMonthlyExpenses"
        ],
        "description": "Totales en ARS sobre `transactions`. Los promedios dividen por los meses con movimientos (incluye el mes en curso).",
        "properties": {
          "totalTransactions": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "totalIncome": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "totalExpenses": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "averageMonthlyIncome": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "averageMonthlyExpenses": {
            "type": "integer"
          }
        }
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "error"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "code",
              "message"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "code": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "missing_credential",
                  "unauthorized",
                  "upstream_error",
                  "unknown_demo_profile",
                  "invalid_term_months"
                ]
              },
              "message": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "ScoringProfile": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "demo",
          "scorecard_version",
          "decided_at",
          "eligible",
          "rejections",
          "score",
          "reasons",
          "offer",
          "no_offer_reason"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "demo": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "`true` si es un perfil sintético (BELO_DEMO_PROFILE). No presentarlo como real."
          },
          "scorecard_version": {
            "type": "string",
            "examples": [
              "v1-expert"
            ]
          },
          "decided_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "eligible": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "`false` si falló algún filtro de elegibilidad"
          },
          "rejections": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CodeMessage"
            },
            "description": "Filtros que fallaron (vacío si es elegible)"
          },
          "score": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ScoreValue"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "reasons": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ScoreReason"
            },
            "description": "Las 3 features que más puntos restaron"
          },
          "offer": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LoanOffer"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "no_offer_reason": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CodeMessage"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Por qué no hay oferta siendo elegible: `low_score`, `no_payment_capacity`, `amount_below_minimum`"
          }
        }
      },
      "CodeMessage": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "code",
          "message"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "string",
            "examples": [
              "short_history"
            ]
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "ScoreValue": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "value",
          "band",
          "base",
          "max"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "value": {
            "type": "integer",
            "examples": [
              700
            ]
          },
          "band": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "A",
              "B",
              "C",
              "D"
            ]
          },
          "base": {
            "type": "integer",
            "examples": [
              300
            ]
          },
          "max": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Score máximo posible",
            "examples": [
              860
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "ScoreReason": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "feature",
          "message"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "feature": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "examples": [
              "Poco colchón de ahorro respecto de tus gastos"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "LoanOffer": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Oferta indicativa y simulada; no es un compromiso de otorgamiento.",
        "required": [
          "band",
          "currency",
          "amount_max_usd",
          "term_months",
          "max_term_months",
          "min_term_months",
          "tna",
          "tea",
          "cft",
          "installment_usd",
          "max_installment_usd",
          "total_payable_usd",
          "valid_until",
          "disclaimer"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "band": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "A",
              "B",
              "C"
            ]
          },
          "currency": {
            "type": "string",
            "examples": [
              "USD"
            ]
          },
          "amount_max_usd": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Monto máximo preaprobado (string decimal)",
            "examples": [
              "1770"
            ]
          },
          "term_months": {
            "type": "integer",
            "examples": [
              9
            ]
          },
          "max_term_months": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "min_term_months": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "tna": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Tasa nominal anual (string decimal)",
            "examples": [
              "0.24"
            ]
          },
          "tea": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Tasa efectiva anual (string decimal)",
            "examples": [
              "0.2682"
            ]
          },
          "cft": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Costo financiero total (= TEA en v1, sin comisiones) (string decimal)",
            "examples": [
              "0.2682"
            ]
          },
          "installment_usd": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Cuota fija (string decimal)",
            "examples": [
              "216.85"
            ]
          },
          "max_installment_usd": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Cuota máxima según capacidad de pago (string decimal)"
          },
          "total_payable_usd": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Total a pagar (string decimal)"
          },
          "valid_until": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "disclaimer": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "Methodology": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "scorecard_version",
          "deterministic",
          "llm_involved",
          "summary",
          "data_window",
          "pipeline",
          "eligibility_gates",
          "score",
          "bands",
          "offer"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "scorecard_version": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "deterministic": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Siempre `true`: mismos datos, mismo resultado"
          },
          "llm_involved": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Siempre `false`: ningún LLM participa del cálculo"
          },
          "summary": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "data_window": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "max_months": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "complete_months_only": {
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "currency": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "pipeline": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "step",
                "function",
                "description"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "step": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "function": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "description": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "eligibility_gates": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "code",
                "rule",
                "description"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "code": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "rule": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "examples": [
                    "partial_pct > 30"
                  ]
                },
                "description": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "score": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "base",
              "max",
              "features",
              "adjustments"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "base": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "max": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "features": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MethodologyFeature"
                }
              },
              "adjustments": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MethodologyAdjustment"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "bands": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "band",
                "min_score",
                "max_score",
                "has_offer"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "band": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "min_score": {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                "max_score": {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                "has_offer": {
                  "type": "boolean"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "offer": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "Reglas de la oferta (valores de negocio placeholder)",
            "properties": {
              "currency": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "amortization": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "by_band": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "income_multiple": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "max_term_months": {
                      "type": "integer"
                    },
                    "tna": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "min_term_months": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "max_installment_rule": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "amount_rule": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "min_loan_usd": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "max_loan_usd": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "valid_days": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "fees": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "disclaimer": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "MethodologyFeature": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "feature",
          "label",
          "description",
          "unit",
          "bins"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "feature": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "label": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "description": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "unit": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "bins": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "rule",
                "from",
                "to",
                "points"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "rule": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "examples": [
                    ">= 0.3 y < 0.6"
                  ]
                },
                "from": {
                  "type": [
                    "string",
                    "null"
                  ],
                  "description": "Desde (incluido); null = sin límite"
                },
                "to": {
                  "type": [
                    "string",
                    "null"
                  ],
                  "description": "Hasta (excluido); null = sin límite"
                },
                "points": {
                  "type": "integer"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "MethodologyAdjustment": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "feature",
          "label",
          "description",
          "unit",
          "condition",
          "points"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "feature": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "label": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "description": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "unit": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "condition": {
            "type": "string",
            "examples": [
              "card_coherence == \"false\""
            ]
          },
          "points": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Bono (+) o penalidad (−)"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
